  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relations with Member States from Europe and North America Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During this period , the Unit for Europe and North America will undertake its core function to support stronger cooperation with MS of the region, including by maintaining regular liaison with the Permanent Delegations by providing them with information on UNESCO&apos;s activities in the context of bilateral and regional cooperation. It will also monitor closely the political and socio-economic developments in the region and provide UNESCO&apos; senior management as well as programme sectors with strategic analyses and appropriate recommendations on bolstering cooperation with the Member States.</narrative>
  </description>
